FADE IN:

INT. MOUNTAIN OPERATIONS ROOM - DAWN

[[AMBIENCE: radio hiss, distant engines, wind against canvas]]
[[MUSIC: restrained military tension]]

A map of the operational area is spread across a table. CAPTAIN ELIAN and MIRA stand over it.

LENKA
(serious)
The enemy is supposedly stockpiling weapons at the arsenal. Our source says the shipments never arrived.

[[SHOT: map]]
[[MAP: operational area, player start, objective route, enemy approach]]

COMMANDER SAVA
(measured)
Then the arsenal may be bait. We need the ledger more than the ammunition.

LENKA
(firm)
Infiltrate the compound, recover the payment records, and withdraw. Avoid destroying the archive building.

[[SFX: radio click]]
[[MUSIC: stop]]

FADE OUT.
